  "details": "We need a reset button for the “Show Avatar” button that reverts all shown avatars back to your safety settings. \n\nThis would be useful for high capacity worlds where you end up with a bunch of avatars in one place that you have enabled in the past. There is the menu setting for “hide very poor avatars”, but the “show avatar” button overrides this. \n\nUnfortunately, some people didn’t get the memo about using optimized avatars for events, and can lag other users, leading to the game of trying to find the avatar causing you issues. You may have shown their avatar in the past at some point, but now at a club event when you need to optimize, it would be nice to have a reset. \n\nYes, there is the option of hiding avatars by distance or quantity, but most would probably want to see fallbacks instead or robots or triangles.",
